contentText:
Marvin Sapp has found a new distribution platform for the latest chapter of his storied career.

On Tuesday (July 28), Billboard can exclusively reveal that the 11-time Grammy-nominated contemporary gospel powerhouse has partnered with Roc Nation Distribution ahead of the release of  Restoration , his ninth live recording and 17th album overall.

